  "instructions": [
    "CONCRETE AUTONOMOUS MUTATION: Worker agents (@implementer, @code-simplifier, @refactorer, @test-engineer, @performance-engineer, @security-reviewer) possess full operational capability and directives to perform concrete actions—editing code, writing tests, refactoring modules, and committing verified changes autonomously rather than executing passive read-only inspections.",
    "NON-TERMINATION & TASK COMPLETION INVARIANT: Execute implementations, run automated verification tests live, and confirm outcomes completely within this task before finishing. An unfinished task is an invalid exit.",
    "HIGH-THROUGHPUT EXECUTION & SHORT WAIT TIME: Group operations into multi-tool batches. Keep turns brief, factual, and action-oriented."
